## Frontend Logic Summary (Decision Table)

| Organizer      | Period    | Price Display                  | Réserver Action                           |
| -------------- | --------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------- |
| Codeacademy123 | À l’année | Total price + sessions + dates | Redirect to Codeacademy123 URL            |
| Codeacademy123 | Vacances  | Total price + sessions         | Redirect to Codeacademy123 URL            |
| Store          | Any       | Optional / simple              | `mailto:lamaisondespetitsloups@gmail.com` |

